to request conversion of Series A shares to Series B shares which was entered in
the Articles of Association at the 2011 Annual General Meeting.

Today, 30 October 2026, the last trading day of the month, there are a total of
2,033,452,084 registered shares in AB Volvo. Of these are 440,143,109 Series A
shares and 1,593,308,975 Series B shares. The number of votes in the company
amounts to 599,474,006.50 based on the number of registered shares.



