195 Series A shares to a total of 195 Series B shares. The conversions were
implemented with the support of the opportunity for Series A shareholders to
request conversion of Series A shares to Series B shares which was entered in
the Articles of Association at the 2011 Annual General Meeting.

Today, 31 August 2026, the last trading day of the month, there are a total of
2,033,452,084 registered shares in AB Volvo. Of these are 440,743,116 Series A
shares and 1,592,708,968 Series B shares. The number of votes in the company
amounts to 600,014,012.80 based on the number of registered shares.



